firmware-node lifetime, return-value, fixed-clock build, CRTC reporting and
eDP lifecycle corrections from the CIX display queue. Exclude the fixed-MMIO
reset, mutable engineering controls and incomplete HDCP test interfaces which
are handled by the following production-hardening patch.

